Package: cbfix-bridge
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libwayland-client0, libx11-6, libxfixes3
Maintainer: macOS-Terminal <chou114514chou@outlook.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/macOS-Terminal/linux-clipboard-fix
Description: Bidirectional clipboard bridge between Wayland and X11 (Xwayland)
 cbfix-bridge is a tiny daemon that keeps the Wayland clipboard
 (ext-data-control-v1) and the X11 CLIPBOARD selection (Xwayland) in sync,
 in both directions, for text and images, including large INCR transfers.
 It fixes X11 applications running under Xwayland that cannot exchange
 clipboard content with native Wayland applications.
 It is shipped as a systemd user service.
